s://web.archive.org/web/20241207052640/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/arts/music/wicked-movie-popcast-ariana-grande.html |archive-date=December 7, 2024 |access-date=December 7, 2024 |newspaper=[[The New York Times]] |quote=Grande and Erivo have been praised for their performances onscreen}}
